{
    "title": "Photos - Wear OS Image Gallery",
    "description": "Image gallery allowing you to browse and display images stored on your watch and in your Google Photos library or Flickr account.\r\n\r\nAnd if you are used to organize your photos in Google Photos or Flickr library into albums those same albums will be available on your watch!\r\n\r\nYou can use all common touch gestures to zoom & pan photos to see every detail you need.\r\n\r\nApp can display basic information about your photos and also download them directly to your watch so you can access them later when offline or use them as a background for your watch face!\r\n\r\nThat's right! Photos come with it's own watch faces so now you can have have a look on your favorite photo every time you check the time.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Image gallery allowing you to browse and display images stored on your watch and in your Google Photos library or Flickr account.<br><br>And if you are used to organize your photos in Google Photos or Flickr library into albums those same albums will be available on your watch!<br><br>You can use all common touch gestures to zoom &amp; pan photos to see every detail you need.<br><br>App can display basic information about your photos and also download them directly to your watch so you can access them later when offline or use them as a background for your watch face!<br><br>That&#39;s right! Photos come with it&#39;s own watch faces so now you can have have a look on your favorite photo every time you check the time.",
